@Barber.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

GET https://localhost:7145/api/tenant
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Register owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123","firstName":"Demo","lastName":"Owner","phone":"+491700000001"}

### Register staff
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"staff@demo.shop","password":"StaffPass123","firstName":"Staff","lastName":"Member","phone":"+491700000002"}

### Login owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/login
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123"}

### Refresh (uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/refresh
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Logout (expect 204, uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/logout
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Me (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/auth/me
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### My bookings (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/booking/mine?skip=0&take=5
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>

### Create booking (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/booking
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"serviceId":"e1e1e1e1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","staffId":"a1a1a1a1-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","startsAt":"2026-09-28T14:30:00.000Z","notes":"Test"}

### Barbers (public)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/staff
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Services (public)
GET https://localhost:7145/api/service
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Change password (needs: Authorization: Bearer <access-token>)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/change-password
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"DemoPass123","newPassword":"DemoPass456"}

